    "title": "Proposed bill would require Florida colleges to rename roads after Charlie Kirk, or lose state funding - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Audra Schroeder ,\n10 hours ago A new House Bill has been proposed, making it mandatory for all Florida colleges and universities to rename roads after Charlie Kirk—or potentially lose state funding. Filed Tuesday by Republican State Rep. Kevin Steele, House Bill 113 requires boards of trustees at all Florida state universities and institutions in the Florida College System rename specific roads after Kirk. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
